ResticHub agent package

This package contains no restic binary. The agent downloads restic from
https://github.com/restic/restic/releases when you register the agent or
install the service, and it verifies the release signature first.

restic is available under the BSD 2-Clause License. The license text is in the
restic source archive of each release.

The agent contains the public release signing key of the restic project
(fingerprint CF8F18F2844575973F79D4E191A6868BD3F7A907).
